# Generated companion-app output.
#
# Prettier only reads the *root* `.gitignore` (and this file), not the nested
# `.gitignore` inside each app, so without these entries it would try to format
# bundles the build just wrote and the data it just generated.
apps/*/dist/
apps/extension/dist-chrome/
apps/extension/dist-firefox/
apps/pwa/public/data/
apps/pwa/lighthouse-report/
apps/extension/playwright-report/
apps/extension/test-results/

# Tree-sitter CLI output; regenerate with `tree-sitter generate`.
grammars/*/src/grammar.json
grammars/*/src/node-types.json
